      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "Create a short explanation for computing teachers: what happens when a student opens a website? Cover DNS lookup when the address is not cached, the HTTP request over an HTTPS connection, and the server response that the browser processes. Use three scenes. Keep it accurate and suitable for beginners."
      ]
    },
